#| msgid ""
#| "The `qiskit-ibm-runtime` package provides a specialized transpiler pass called [`FoldRzzAngle`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-fold-rzz-angle).\n"
